<title>USA: Retirement Care refuses comment on activity.</title>
<headline>Retirement Care refuses comment on activity.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Retirement Care Associates Inc declined to comment on any corporate developments that may explain its unusual stock activity.</p>
<p>Retirement Care said that its policy is not to comment on unusual market activity or rumors, according to the NYSE.</p>
<p>Trading in Retirement Care's stock has been halted on the NYSE. Its last sale was 6-1/2.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
